BUC testing it) you can generally find boots/helm better than +0.

> In the BoH:
> +0 Oilskin (bones), +0 Jumping (bones), -1 Levitation (shop)

I'd have the jumping boots on unless I was about to go into a
zoo/leprechaun hall/etc.  They're the best boots in the game (better
than speed) in my opinion.

