> d) I have an unidentified scroll I've narrowed down to either genocide
> or charging.  Levitate out over the water (unknown b/u/c) and read it.
> I'd hate to waste a possible blessed ?charging, though.
>

Both of those scrolls you're going to want blessed.  Save it for now.

> e) Break out the /oDeath (unknown b/u/c and charges) with Master Kaen's
> name written on it.  I would prefer to not do this.

If you need it, don't hesitate to use it.  Master Kaen can be killed
safely with a boulder fort + wands of cold (or other attack wands).
